```

### File Descriptions

```
- MotivationalQuotesApp/: 
  The root directory for the MotivationalQuotesApp project.

- data/: 
  Directory containing all data files for storing quotes, user credentials, and favorite quotes.

  - Quotes.txt: 
    A text file that stores motivational quotes along with their authors in the format "Quote|Author".

  - Users.txt: 
    A text file that stores user credentials in the format "Username|Password".

  - Favorites.txt: 
    A text file that stores favorite quotes for each user in the format "Username|Quote|Author".

- templates/: 
  Directory containing HTML templates for the web application.

  - login.html: 
    HTML file for the login page where users can enter their credentials.

  - home.html: 
    HTML file for the home page displaying all motivational quotes and options to add, edit, or delete quotes.

  - add_quote.html: 
    HTML file for the page where users can add a new motivational quote.

  - edit_quote.html: 
    HTML file for the page where users can edit an existing quote.

  - delete_confirmation.html: 
    HTML file for the confirmation page that appears before deleting a quote.

  - favorites.html: 
    HTML file for the page displaying all favorite quotes of the user.

  - about.html: 
    HTML file for the about page containing application description and developer information.

- app.py: 
  The main Python file containing the backend logic for the MotivationalQuotesApp, handling user authentication, quote management, and data storage.

- requirements.txt: 
  A text file listing all the required Python packages and dependencies for the application.
```

